			<li><a href="/PAGEGWS/GWS2002/GWS2002_S05.aspx"><div class="Sub_left_mn_in"><img src="../../images/icon_26.png"/> </div> <span>결재진행함</span></a></li>
      <li><a href="/PAGEGWS/GWS2002/GWS2002_S10.aspx"><div class="Sub_left_mn_in"><img src="../../images/icon_26.png"/> </div> <span>결재완료함</span></a></li>
